WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.290
- Before we say goodbye,

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:03.780
I have a story from the internet
I want to share with y'all.

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:05.176
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:05.176 --> 00:00:08.070
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.830
More people are keeping goats as pets

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:12.180
and for good reason.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:14.280
They're great companions, and super fun.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.110
And they'll clear your backyards of weeds,

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:17.130
which is helpful.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.340
Of course, they do come
with a few drawbacks.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.500
The horns can be a problem.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.340
That's Dobby, the goat
who found a loose Cheerio

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.803
on the stairs and decided to risk it all.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:30.810
Sounds like Dobby got into

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.403
the stash at home or something.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.560
He really wanted that Cheerio.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.240
Don't worry Dobby!

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.740
He was freed.

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:39.180
We have him on the line now

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.170
along with his owner,

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.510
Isria from their backyard
at North Carolina.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:45.600
They watch on WCCB Charlotte CW at five.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.845
What's up Isria?

00:00:46.845 --> 00:00:48.658
(audience cheering)

00:00:48.658 --> 00:00:50.160
- How are you?

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:51.330
- I am so good.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:54.150
So he seems okay. Dobby seems okay.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:56.040
- Yeah, he's totally fine.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.810
It was a little bit nerve wracking

00:00:57.810 --> 00:00:59.373
when I saw him initially,

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.670
but he was fine.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:06.000
He saw a Cheerio and did
not want it to go to waste

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.040
and it took me a minute to figure out

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.470
how he got wedged into the stairs,

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.510
but he must have just used brute strength

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:13.620
'cuz his horns are curved.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:16.230
So once he was in, I
could not get him out.

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:18.000
But luckily my luck guy was on the way

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.120
and helped me pry up the stairs

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:22.860
and get him out.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:24.180
- Well I love this.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:26.460
So Dobby actually has
brothers and sisters, right?

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.110
And where are they?

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:30.873
- [Isria] Yes, they are
scattered about right now.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.647
They're all named after
Harry Potter references.

00:01:34.647 --> 00:01:36.390
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:37.803
Take that Gwen Stefani.

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.060
I thought that yeah, you named Dobby

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.650
after a Harry Potter character, yes.

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:46.965
- Oh yeah, it was definitely a reference.

00:01:46.965 --> 00:01:49.200
Then I have Lumos and
her daughter Norberta,

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.820
we call her Bertie for short.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:53.910
Extra points if you can
figure out that reference.

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:56.550
And then recently we adopted Padfoot

00:01:56.550 --> 00:02:00.000
and Willow from a sanctuary
here in North Carolina.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.260
- That's awesome.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:02.580
Well, I love you,

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:03.660
and I love all your goats,

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:05.610
and I really love those two
chairs that I wanna come over

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:07.350
and have a drink with
you and just chill in.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.850
Those chairs look real comfortable girl.

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:10.530
The little hanging ones behind you.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.060
Thank you so much, Isria.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.625
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:15.374
(audience claps)

00:02:15.374 --> 00:02:16.207
And that's not all,

00:02:16.207 --> 00:02:18.000
our season long partner Pilot pin makers

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.050
of Frxion to goats to race

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:20.430
Bull pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.830
want to celebrate those
who live fearlessly

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.720
and that includes goats as well, y'all.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.051
So they're giving you a thousand dollars.

00:02:27.051 --> 00:02:29.598
(audience cheers)

00:02:29.598 --> 00:02:30.603
- Say thank you.

00:02:30.603 --> 00:02:31.947
- [Kelly] Thank you so much Isria!

00:02:31.947 --> 00:02:33.750
And thank you to all my guests today!

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.030
Quin Stefani, Melissa Villasenor,

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:37.740
Dave, Lisa, Audrey, and Myla,

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:38.573
y'all have a great day

00:02:38.573 --> 00:02:40.770
and if it's not try and change it.

